 Context","name":"h3_context","type":"MINIMAX_H3_CONTEXT","links":[19]}],"properties":{"cnr_id":"comfyui-minimaxh3-easy","ver":"0b23d8783bf98d72e9778fd70541b0846770b5f3","Node name for S&R":"MiniMaxH3Easy","minimax_h3_virtual_media_links":[],"aux_id":"nkxx188/ComfyUI-MiniMaxH3-Easy","minimax_h3_prompt_reference_doc":{"version":1,"text":"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a tight medium shot of Will Smith (S1), middle-aged Black man in a black tuxedo, standing at the Oscars podium under bright stage lights. He holds a microphone close to his mouth and speaks with a confident, slightly arrogant tone: <d>[English] Jackie Chan's wife? Man, that woman is so ugly she makes Jackie look handsome by comparison.</d> His expression is smug. [Shot 2] At 00:03.500, the camera cuts to a medium close-up of Jackie Chan (S2), older Asian man in a black tuxedo, already rising and stepping onto the stage with a furious face. The camera pushes in slightly as he moves toward Will Smith. [Shot 3] At 00:05.500, the shot cuts to a tight medium shot as Jackie Chan launches a rapid series of hard kung-fu strikes — punches and kicks land solidly on Will Smith. Will Smith staggers and tries to block but is overwhelmed. Jackie Chan keeps attacking with powerful, clear body movements, driving Will Smith backward until he drops. The framing stays close on both men throughout the fight so the action remains readable.\n\noverall_soundscape: Close microphone presence under the dialogue. Sharp, solid impacts of fists and feet hitting a body, heavy breathing, fabric movement, and a sudden wave of shocked audience gasps once the fight starts.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: Sparse low percussion that builds into a short, hard martial-arts drum pattern during the fight, then cuts.","parts":[{"type":"text","text":"integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a tight medium shot of Will Smith (S1), middle-aged Black man in a black tuxedo, standing at the Osca